        "Reviewer: %@. The suggestion only moves the markers in this preview; it cannot build or save the rig.": Entry(japanese: "確認元: %@。提案で変わるのはこのプレビュー上のマーカー位置だけです。リグの作成や保存は行われません。", english: "Reviewer: %@. The suggestion only moves the markers in this preview; it cannot build or save the rig."),
