        "The anime landmark model could not read this face well (photos and unusual proportions are hard for it), so Apple Vision placed the markers. You can switch back under Detection candidate.": Entry(japanese: "アニメ向けランドマークモデルではこの顔をうまく読み取れなかったため（実写や特殊な頭身は苦手です）、Apple Visionがマーカーを配置しました。「検出候補」から元に戻せます。", english: "The anime landmark model could not read this face well (photos and unusual proportions are hard for it), so Apple Vision placed the markers. You can switch back under Detection candidate."),
